actly tag, amount and enabled, with a Unicode string tag, signed integer amount and Boolean enabled.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:f24a391c9fb1c31e0d6fbfa13527bcb28a855696a85bdb7b7f2b70830b1acdfa", "document_ref": "data-pipelines/P02-row-projection.txt", "end_byte": 153, "interpretation": "Top-level input schema.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 85}, {"document_hash": "sha256:f24a391c9fb1c31e0d6fbfa13527bcb28a855696a85bdb7b7f2b70830b1acdfa", "document_ref": "data-pipelines/P02-row-projection.txt", "end_byte": 182, "interpretation": "Threshold domain.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 154}, {"document_hash": "sha256:f24a391c9fb1c31e0d6fbfa13527bcb28a855696a85bdb7b7f2b70830b1acdfa", "document_ref": "data-pipelines/P02-row-projection.txt", "end_byte": 346, "interpretation": "Row schema and field domains.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 183}], "scope": ["input domain"], "dependencies": [], "acceptance_criteria": ["Input field names are exactly rows and minimum.", "minimum has the signed integer domain.", "rows is a list; each row has exactly tag, amount and enabled with the stated types."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:cd5bc0703afc9830d02eedc2829e8369dae2fe9373c2776684c21a43aae58019", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O1", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "Retain every and only input row whose enabled value is true and whose amount is greater than or equal to minimum.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:f24a391c9fb1c31e0d6fbfa13527bcb28a855696a85bdb7b7f2b70830b1acdfa", "document_ref": "data-pipelines/P02-row-projection.txt", "end_byte": 450, "interpretation": "Exact filtering predicate, including equality at the threshold.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 347}], "scope": ["all inputs in D2"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D2", "relation": "uses_definition"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["An input row occurrence is retained if and only if enabled is